This photo shows a nearly empty tray after a meal. The plate has only yellow residue, which looks like egg or sauce. There is a butter tub that is partly used and still holds some butter, a second empty tub, and a yogurt cup that looks empty. A crumpled foil wrapper sits nearby.

The food left on the plate is a small smear, perhaps 5 g, at about 5-10 kcal. The butter remaining in the tub is around 5 g, at about 36 kcal. The residue in the yogurt cup and the foil adds very little, maybe 5 kcal. That makes roughly 15 g of food in total and about 45 kcal.

